{"seq":2,"at":"2026-10-20","kind":"edited","target":{"type":"article","id":"a1829"},"reason":"Rewritten by the merge to take in the printed cards' questions.","by":"merge sport-games/motor-winter","ref":"quiz-archive/runs/tp-ingest/decisions/sport-games__motor-winter.g1.json","changes":[{"field":"bodyEn","diff":[["=",94],["-","winter."],["+","winter"],["=",1],["+","– the modern Snowboard descends from the \"Snurfer\", two skis tied together, which Sherman Poppen invented for his daughter in 1965. "],["=",620],["+","Each sport also has its showpiece. Longboard surfers walk to the front of a long board and curl all ten toes over the nose while the wave carries them – the trick is called Hang Ten, and with one foot it is hang five. Skateboarding answered with the acid drop: the rider rolls straight off a ledge or the deck of a ramp and falls through the air into the halfpipe without grabbing the board, a move credited to the Californian Duane Peters.\n\n"],["=",283],["+","\n| Hang Ten | surf | ten toes over the nose |\n| Acid drop | skate | drop into the pipe |"],["=",5],["-","five"],["+","seven"],["=",30]]},{"field":"bodyDe","diff":[["=",96],["-","suchten."],["+","suchten"],["=",1],["+","– das moderne Snowboard stammt vom „Snurfer“ ab, zwei zusammengebundenen Skiern, die Sherman Poppen 1965 für seine Tochter erfand. "],["=",634],["+","Jede Sportart hat zudem ihr Glanzstück. Longboard-Surfer gehen auf einem langen Brett nach vorn und krallen alle zehn Zehen über die Spitze, während die Welle sie trägt – der Trick heißt Hang Ten, mit einem Fuß Hang Five. "],["=",2],["+","Skateboarding antwortete mit dem Acid Drop: Der Fahrer rollt geradewegs über einen Absatz oder das Plateau einer Rampe hinaus und fällt durch die Luft in die Halfpipe, ohne das Brett zu greifen – eine Figur, die dem Kalifornier Duane Peters zugeschrieben wird.\n\nDas "],["=",277],["+","\n| Hang Ten | Surf | zehn Zehen über der Spitze |\n| Acid Drop | Skate | Sprung in die Pipe |"],["=",5],["-","fünf"],["+","sieben"],["=",28]]}]},
